return {h=12,w=470,cr=30,hc=25,bh=35,gr="medium-slow",eg={"ground"},st={65,130,60,75,60,75},ab={{46,0},{105,0},{154,1}},genus={en="Disaster Pokémon",es="Pokémon Catástrofe",pt="Pokémon Desastre"},flavor={en={[7]="Every time ABSOL appears before people, it is followed by a disaster such as an earthquake or a tidal wave. As a result, it came to be known as the disaster Pokémon.",[8]="ABSOL has the ability to foretell the coming of natural disasters. It lives in a harsh, rugged mountain environment. This Pokémon very rarely ventures down from the mountains.",[9]="It sharply senses even subtle changes in the sky and the land to predict natural disasters. It is a long-lived Pokémon that has a life-span of 100 years.",[10]="It appears when it senses an impending natural disaster. As a result, it was mistaken as a doom-bringer.",[11]="It appears when it senses an impending natural disaster. As a result, it was mistaken as a doom-bringer.",[12]="It senses coming disasters and appears before people only to warn them of impending danger.",[13]="It senses coming disasters and appears before people only to warn them of impending danger.",[14]="Rumored to sense disasters with its horn, it became a target. It fled deep into the mountains.",[15]="It has the ability to foretell natural disasters. Its life span is over a hundred years.",[16]="It has the ability to foretell natural disasters. Its life span is over a hundred years.",[17]="Rumored to sense disasters with its horn, it became a target. It fled deep into the mountains.",[18]="Rumored to sense disasters with its horn, it became a target. It fled deep into the mountains.",[21]="It appears from deep in the mountains to warn people about upcoming disasters it has sensed with its horn.",[22]="It appears from deep in the mountains to warn people about upcoming disasters it has sensed with its horn.",[23]="It senses coming disasters and appears before people only to warn them of impending danger.",[24]="It appears when it senses an impending natural disaster. As a result, it was mistaken as a doom bringer.",[25]="Every time Absol appears before people, it is followed by a disaster such as an earthquake or a tidal wave. As a result, it came to be known as the disaster Pokémon.",[26]="Absol has the ability to foretell the coming of natural disasters. It lives in a harsh, rugged mountain environment. This Pokémon very rarely ventures down from the mountains.",[27]="Long ago, superstitions were spread about it, saying it brought disaster. This fed a hatred of it, and it was driven deep into the mountains.",[28]="Although it’s said to bring disaster, in actuality, this Pokémon possesses a calm disposition and warns people of any crises that loom.",[29]="The only thing unlucky about Absol is its appearance. It protects fields and warns people of disaster, so one ought to be grateful for it.",[30]="The elderly call it the disaster Pokémon and detest it, but interest in its power to predict disasters is on the rise.",[33]="Swift as the wind, Absol races through fields and mountains. Its curved, bow-like horn is acutely sensitive to the warning signs of natural disasters.",[34]="Because of this Pokémon’s ability to detect danger, people mistook Absol as a bringer of doom."},es={[23]="Presiente desastres inminentes y se aparece a la gente para advertir del peligro.",[24]="Aparece cuando prevé una catástrofe natural inminente, por eso dicen que trae mala suerte.",[25]="Cada vez que Absol aparece ante la gente, ocurre una catástrofe natural como un terremoto o un maremoto. Por esta razón se le conoce como el Pokémon de las catástrofes.",[26]="Absol tiene la habilidad de predecir las catástrofes naturales. Este Pokémon vive en hábitats montañosos, hostiles y accidentados de los que rara vez se aleja.",[27]="Repudiado por las supersticiones de antaño que lo proclamaban heraldo de catástrofes naturales, tuvo que refugiarse en las montañas.",[28]="Se rumorea que es portador de calamidades, pero en realidad tiene un carácter muy dócil. Alerta a los humanos cuando vienen catástrofes.",[29]="Aunque su apariencia sea siniestra, en realidad le agradecen que alerte de cualquier catástrofe inminente y que proteja los cultivos.",[30]="Pese a que los ancianos lo repudian tildándolo de Pokémon Catástrofe, cada vez es mayor el interés por su capacidad de prever desastres.",[33]="Corre por montañas y prados a la velocidad del viento. Su cuerno curvado tiene tal sensibilidad que puede predecir catástrofes naturales.",[34]="Debido a su capacidad para predecir desastres, se lo ha considerado desacertadamente un Pokémon portador de desgracias."},pt="Por causa da capacidade deste Pokémon de detectar perigo, as pessoas confundiram Absol com um portador da desgraça."},evo={{s=359}},moves={[5]={1,10,5,43,9,269,13,98,17,13,21,44,26,14,31,104,36,163,41,248,46,195},[6]={1,10,5,43,9,269,13,98,17,13,21,44,26,14,31,104,36,163,41,248,46,195},[7]={1,10,5,43,9,269,13,98,17,13,21,44,26,14,31,104,36,163,41,248,46,195},[8]={1,10,4,43,9,269,12,98,17,13,20,228,25,14,28,44,33,104,36,163,41,248,44,389,49,197,52,400,57,382,60,427,65,195},[9]={1,10,1,364,4,43,9,269,12,98,17,13,20,228,25,14,28,44,33,104,36,163,41,248,44,389,49,197,52,400,57,382,60,427,65,195},[10]={1,10,1,364,4,43,9,269,12,98,17,13,20,228,25,14,28,44,33,104,36,163,41,248,44,389,49,197,52,400,57,382,60,427,65,195},[11]={1,10,1,364,4,43,9,269,12,98,17,13,20,228,25,14,28,44,33,104,36,163,41,248,44,389,49,197,52,400,57,382,60,427,65,195},[12]={1,10,5,43,9,269,13,98,17,13,21,44,26,14,31,104,36,163,41,248,46,195},[13]={1,10,5,43,9,269,13,98,17,13,21,44,26,14,31,104,36,163,41,248,46,195},[14]={1,10,1,364,4,43,9,98,12,228,17,269,20,44,25,104,28,163,33,14,36,248,41,400,44,197,49,427,52,389,57,13,60,382,65,195},[15]={1,195,1,382,1,13,1,197,1,269,1,10,1,364,4,43,9,98,12,228,17,269,20,44,25,104,28,163,33,14,36,248,41,400,44,197,47,427,50,389,57,13,60,382,65,195},[16]={1,195,1,248,1,10,1,364,1,43,1,98,4,43,7,98,10,228,13,269,16,44,19,104,22,163,25,14